<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= appTitle %> - Repair Identity Aliases</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-container">
    <main class="main-content" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 2rem auto; width: 100%; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h1 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: #09090b; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Repair Identity Aliases & Clean Duplicates</h1>
        
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;">
          Run an automated maintenance scan to resolve and merge duplicate lead records.
        </p>

        <ul style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;">
          <li>Scans all local SQLite leads for matching Phone / LID aliases.</li>
          <li>Merges duplicate leads into the older canonical lead record without losing chat history.</li>
          <li>Purges any false leads accidentally created for the connected business account number.</li>
          <li>Recomputes lead activity timestamps and latest message previews.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="admin-form-actions" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
          <a href="/app/<%= appSecret %>" class="btn" style="background-color: var(--border-color); color: var(--text-main); justify-content: center;">
            Cancel
          </a>

          <form action="/app/<%= appSecret %>/admin/repair-identities" method="POST" style="margin: 0;">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
              Run Repair Scan Now
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
